<title>USA: Universal Seismic chairman resigns.</title>
<headline>Universal Seismic chairman resigns.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Universal Seismic Associates Inc said Tuesday that Rick Trapp resigned as chairman of the board of directors to pursue other interests.</p>
</text>
